#: ckan/templates/home/snippets/about_text.html
msgid "<p>CKAN is the world’s leading open-source data portal platform.</p> <p>CKAN is a complete out-of-the-box software solution that makes data accessible and usable – by providing tools to streamline publishing, sharing, finding and using data (including storage of data and provision of robust data APIs). CKAN is aimed at data publishers (national and regional governments, companies and organizations) wanting to make their data open and available.</p> <p>CKAN is used by governments and user groups worldwide and powers a variety of official and community data portals including portals for local, national and international government, such as the UK’s <a href=\"https://data.gov.uk\">data.gov.uk</a> and the United States <a href=\"https://catalog.data.gov/\">catalog.data.gov</a>, the Brazilian <a href=\"https://dados.gov.br/\">dados.gov.br</a>, Dutch and Netherland government portals, as well as city and municipal sites in the US, UK, Argentina, Finland and elsewhere.</p> <p>CKAN: <a href=\"https://ckan.org/\">https://ckan.org/</a><br /> CKAN Showcases: <a href=\"https://ckan.org/showcase\">https://ckan.org/showcase</a><br /> Features overview: <a href=\"https://ckan.org/features/\">https://ckan.org/features/</a></p>"
msgstr "<p>CKAN no sehatra rindrambaiko open source lohalaharana eran-tany amin'ny fananganana tranonkala fizarana angona.</p> <p>CKAN dia rindrambaiko feno sady vonona hampiasaina, izay manamora ny fahazoana sy ny fampiasana angona. Manolotra fitaovana hanamorana ny famoahana, fizarana, fitadiavana ary fampiasana angona izy, anisan'izany ny fitehirizana angona sy ny API angona matanjaka. Natao ho an'ireo mpamoaka angona (fitondram-panjakana foibe sy isam-paritra, orinasa ary fikambanana) maniry hampisokatra sy hanome fahafahana hahazo ny angon-drakiny ny CKAN.</p> <p>Ampiasain'ny fitondram-panjakana sy vondron'ny mpampiasa maneran-tany ny CKAN. Izy no mampandeha tranonkala fizarana angona ofisialy sy an'ny vondrom-piarahamonina maro, anisan'izany ireo an'ny fitondram-panjakana eo an-toerana, nasionaly ary iraisam-pirenena. Ohatra amin'izany ny <a href=\"https://data.gov.uk\">data.gov.uk</a> any amin'ny Fanjakana Mitambatra, ny <a href=\"https://catalog.data.gov/\">catalog.data.gov</a> any Etazonia, ny <a href=\"https://dados.gov.br/\">dados.gov.br</a> any Brezila, ary ireo tranonkala fizarana angon'ny governemanta any Holandy. Eo koa ireo tranonkalan'ny tanàna sy kaominina any Etazonia, any amin'ny Fanjakana Mitambatra, any Arzantina, any Finlandy ary any an-kafa.</p> <p>CKAN: <a href=\"https://ckan.org/\">https://ckan.org/</a><br /> Ohatra amin'ny fampiasana CKAN: <a href=\"https://ckan.org/showcase\">https://ckan.org/showcase</a><br /> Topimaso momba ireo fitaovana sy fiasa: <a href=\"https://ckan.org/features/\">https://ckan.org/features/</a></p>"

