#: ckanext/nice_ui/templates/home/about.html
msgid "Open data on agroecology in Madagascar, shared by Sahan'Aina."
msgstr "Angona misokatra momba ny agroécologie eto Madagasikara, zarain'i Sahan'Aina."

#: ckanext/nice_ui/templates/home/about.html
msgid "A farm where every resource feeds the next"
msgstr "Toeram-pambolena izay ahitana ny loharanon-karena tsirairay mamelona ny manaraka"

#: ckanext/nice_ui/templates/home/about.html
msgid "Sahan'Aina is an integrated agroecological farm in the highlands of Madagascar. Created in 2024, it links market gardening, an orchard, livestock, fish farming and fertiliser production in a single system: what leaves one activity becomes the input of the next."
msgstr "Sahan'Aina dia toeram-pambolena agroécologique mitambatra any amin'ny faritra afovoan-tanin'i Madagasikara. Natsangana tamin'ny 2024, mampifandray ny fambolena legioma, ny tanimboankazo, ny fiompiana, ny fiompiana trondro ary ny famokarana zezika ao anatin'ny rafitra tokana izy: izay mivoaka avy amin'ny asa iray dia lasa fitaovana ho an'ny manaraka."

#: ckanext/nice_ui/templates/home/about.html
msgid "The goal is concrete: produce better with less dependence, regenerate soils and show that a resilient farm can also be economically viable."
msgstr "Mazava ny tanjona: mamokatra tsara kokoa nefa tsy dia miankin-doha loatra, mamelona indray ny tany ary maneho fa ny toeram-pambolena mahatohitra dia afaka mahavelona ara-toekarena ihany koa."

#: ckanext/nice_ui/templates/home/about.html
msgid "pilot farm"
msgstr "toeram-pambolena modely"

#: ckanext/nice_ui/templates/home/about.html
msgid "interconnected poles"
msgstr "sehatra mifampitohy"

#: ckanext/nice_ui/templates/home/about.html
