msgid "Three poles, one continuous cycle"
msgstr "Sehatra telo, tsingerina iray tsy tapaka"

#: ckanext/nice_ui/templates/home/about.html
msgid "The activities do not work in silos: they exchange matter, energy and value."
msgstr "Tsy miasa mitokana ireo asa: mifanakalo zavatra, angovo ary lanja izy ireo."

