msgid "Crops and food"
msgstr "Voly sy sakafo"

#: ckanext/nice_ui/templates/home/about.html
msgid "Market gardening fertilised entirely with rabbit manure"
msgstr "Fambolena legioma asiana zezika bitro tanteraka"

#: ckanext/nice_ui/templates/home/about.html
msgid "Fodder grown on the farm"
msgstr "Sakafom-biby ambolena eo amin'ny toeram-pambolena"

#: ckanext/nice_ui/templates/home/about.html
msgid "A diverse orchard suited to the climate"
msgstr "Tanimboankazo samihafa mifanaraka amin'ny toetrandro"

#: ckanext/nice_ui/templates/home/about.html
msgid "Mulching, ollas and recycled fish-pond water"
msgstr "Fanaronana ny tany, ollas ary ranon-kamory trondro averina ampiasaina"

#: ckanext/nice_ui/templates/home/about.html
msgid "Recovery and fertility"
msgstr "Fanararaotana sy fahavokarana"

#: ckanext/nice_ui/templates/home/about.html
msgid "Composting of manure and crop residues"
msgstr "Fanaovana compost amin'ny tain-biby sy sisa tavela amin'ny voly"

#: ckanext/nice_ui/templates/home/about.html
msgid "Vermicompost and liquid fertiliser"
msgstr "Lombricompost sy zezika ranoka"

#: ckanext/nice_ui/templates/home/about.html
msgid "Biochar made from woody plant matter"
msgstr "Biochar vita amin'ny zava-maniry hazo"

#: ckanext/nice_ui/templates/home/about.html
msgid "Everything returns to the soil to restart the cycle"
msgstr "Miverina any amin'ny tany ny zava-drehetra mba hanombohana indray ny tsingerina"

#: ckanext/nice_ui/templates/home/about.html
msgid "Why share the data"
msgstr "Nahoana no zaraina ny angona"

#: ckanext/nice_ui/templates/home/about.html
msgid "Sahan'Aina wants its model to travel. Akademia Sahan'Aina publishes the data behind the farm's work so that farmers, students, researchers and partners can learn from it and reuse it."
msgstr "Tian'i Sahan'Aina hiely any lavitra ny modeliny. Mamoaka ny angona avy amin'ny asan'ny toeram-pambolena ny Akademia Sahan'Aina mba hahafahan'ny mpamboly, mpianatra, mpikaroka ary mpiara-miombon'antoka mianatra avy aminy sy mampiasa azy indray."

#: ckanext/nice_ui/templates/home/about.html
msgid "Regenerate"
msgstr "Mamelona indray"

#: ckanext/nice_ui/templates/home/about.html
msgid "Improve soil structure and fertility for the long term, without chemical inputs."
msgstr "Manatsara maharitra ny firafitra sy ny fahavokaran'ny tany, tsy misy zezika simika."

#: ckanext/nice_ui/templates/home/about.html
msgid "Pass on"
msgstr "Mampita"

#: ckanext/nice_ui/templates/home/about.html
msgid "Train people in circular practices and grow lasting rural skills."
msgstr "Mampiofana amin'ny fomba fiasa mihodina sy mampitombo fahaiza-manao maharitra any ambanivohitra."

#: ckanext/nice_ui/templates/home/about.html
msgid "Reproduce"
msgstr "Mampiely"

#: ckanext/nice_ui/templates/home/about.html
msgid "Document a model that other Malagasy farms can adapt to their own context."
msgstr "Manoratra modely azon'ny toeram-pambolena malagasy hafa ampifanarahina amin'ny toe-javatra misy azy."

#: ckanext/nice_ui/templates/home/about.html
msgid "Using the data"
msgstr "Fampiasana ny angona"

#: ckanext/nice_ui/templates/home/about.html
msgid "Every dataset states its licence: check it before reusing the data."
msgstr "Asehon'ny angon-drakitra tsirairay ny fahazoan-dalana ampiasainy: jereo izany alohan'ny hampiasanao indray ny angona."

#: ckanext/nice_ui/templates/home/about.html
msgid "Preview tables and maps in your browser, or download the files."
msgstr "Topazo maso ao amin'ny navigateur-nao ny tabilao sy sarintany, na sintony ny rakitra."

#: ckanext/nice_ui/templates/home/about.html
msgid "Automate downloads and updates with the API."
msgstr "Ataovy mandeha ho azy ny fisintonana sy fanavaozana amin'ny API."

#: ckanext/nice_ui/templates/home/about.html
msgid "API documentation"
msgstr "Torolalana momba ny API"

#: ckanext/nice_ui/templates/home/about.html
msgid "Akademia Sahan'Aina runs on CKAN, the open-source data portal software."
msgstr "Mandeha amin'ny CKAN ny Akademia Sahan'Aina, rindrambaiko open source ho an'ny vavahadin'angona."

#: ckanext/nice_ui/templates/home/about.html
msgid "Contact"
msgstr "Fifandraisana"

#: ckanext/nice_ui/templates/home/about.html
msgid "Talk to the team"
msgstr "Resaho ny ekipa"

#: ckanext/nice_ui/templates/home/about.html
msgid "A question about a dataset, or data to share? Write to us."
msgstr "Manana fanontaniana momba ny angon-drakitra, na angona hozaraina? Manorata aminay."

#: ckanext/nice_ui/templates/home/index.html
msgid "Madagascar"
msgstr "Madagasikara"

#: ckanext/nice_ui/templates/home/index.html
msgid "Find, preview and download open datasets on farming in Madagascar."
msgstr "Tadiavo, topazo maso ary sintony ireo angona misokatra momba ny fambolena eto Madagasikara."

#: ckanext/nice_ui/templates/home/index.html
msgid "Explore data by region"
msgstr "Hijery angona isam-paritra"

#: ckanext/nice_ui/templates/home/index.html
msgid "Datasets tagged with the name of a region appear on the map. Select a region to see its datasets."
msgstr "Miseho eo amin'ny sarintany ireo angon-drakitra nasiana ny anaran'ny faritra ho teny fanalahidy. Mifidiana faritra iray hijerena ireo angon-drakitra mifandraika aminy."

#: ckanext/nice_ui/templates/home/index.html
msgid "From the field"
msgstr "Avy any an-tsaha"

#: ckanext/nice_ui/templates/home/index.html
msgid "Data rooted in real farms."
msgstr "Angona avy amin'ny zava-misy eny amin'ny toeram-pambolena."

#: ckanext/nice_ui/templates/home/index.html
msgid "Open to everyone."
msgstr "Misokatra ho an'ny rehetra."

#: ckanext/nice_ui/templates/home/index.html
msgid "Harvests, rainfall, soil and market prices, collected on agroecological farms and shared openly."
msgstr "Angona momba ny vokatra, ny rotsak'orana, ny tany ary ny vidin'entana eny an-tsena, nangonina teny amin'ny toeram-pambolena mampihatra ny agroécologie ary zaraina malalaka."

#: ckanext/nice_ui/templates/home/index.html
msgid "Agroecology"
msgstr "Agroécologie"

#: ckanext/nice_ui/templates/home/index.html
msgid "Nothing is lost. Every resource feeds the next."
msgstr "Tsy misy very. Ny akora tsirairay dia mamelona ny dingana manaraka."

#: ckanext/nice_ui/templates/organization/snippets/helper.html
msgid "Organizations are used to create, manage and publish collections of datasets. Users can have different roles within an Organization, depending on their level of authorisation to create, edit and publish."
msgstr "Ny fikambanana dia ahafahana mamorona, mitantana ary mamoaka fanangonana angon-drakitra. Samy afaka manana ny andraikiny ao amin'ny fikambanana ny mpampiasa, arakaraka ny alalana nomena azy hamorona, hanova ary hamoaka angon-drakitra."

#: ckanext/nice_ui/templates/package/base_form_page.html
msgid "A dataset is a collection of data resources (such as files), together with a description and other information, at a fixed URL. Datasets are what users see when searching for data."
msgstr "Ny angon-drakitra dia fitambaran'ny ressources misy angona (toy ny rakitra), miaraka amin'ny famaritana sy fampahalalana hafa, azo jerena amin'ny URL raikitra iray. Ireo angon-drakitra ireo no hitan'ny mpampiasa rehefa mikaroka angona."

#: ckanext/nice_ui/templates/user/edit.html
msgid "Your profile lets other users know about who you are and what you do."
msgstr "Ny mombamomba anao dia mampahafantatra ireo mpampiasa hafa hoe iza ianao ary inona no ataonao."

